<mjml>
  <mj-include path="./partials/head.mjml" />
  <mj-body background-color="#FFFFFF" width="660px">
    <mj-include path="./partials/header.mjml" />

    <mj-section padding-top="12px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text>Hello,&nbsp;*|FNAME|*!</mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          Your application to continue saving in the second pillar has been cancelled.
          Contributions will not start, and there is nothing more you need to do right now.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          The decision is yours, and it's completely understandable if you want to give it more
          thought. On <a href="https://tuleva.ee/en/rejoining-the-second-pillar/">our rejoining page</a>
          we've set out what rejoining means for you, both the benefits and the limits.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          If you do decide to start saving in the second pillar again, you can submit a new
          application in <a href="https://pension.tuleva.ee/account">your Tuleva account</a>.
          When contributions start depends on when you submit the new application.
        </mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          The cancellation application has been sent to Pensionikeskus and a copy is attached to
          this email.
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-include path="./partials/contact_en.mjml" />
    <mj-section padding="0 24px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-text padding-top="12px">Best wishes,</mj-text>
        <mj-text>
          Tõnu Pekk<br />
          Founder and fund manager of Tuleva
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
    <mj-include path="./partials/disclaimer_second_pillar_rejoin_en.mjml" />
    <mj-include path="./partials/footer_bottom_fund.mjml" />
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
